  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the attached wsdl, when I am running command:<br/>
<br/>
wsdl2java -validate bug.wsdl<br/>
<br/>
it shows:<br/>
WSDLToJava Error : Violate WSI-BP-1.0 R2717 soapBody in the input/output of the binding operation &#39;pingMe&#39; MUST have namespace attribute<br/>
<br/>
but this is a document/literal bare binding.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
