                <tr id="issuerow12379208" rel="12379208" data-issuekey="CXF-1072" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1072" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1072">CXF-1072</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXFServlet can&#39;t be configured without using Spring.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Corey Puffalt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Corey Puffalt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Sep/07 16:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Dec/07 19:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Nov/07 02:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Tomcat v5.5.17
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXFServlet appears to be designed to allow configuration without using Spring via the loadBusNoConfig() method called from init() but although reflection is used to test for the existence of the Spring ApplicationContext class, elsewhere in the code there is an instance variable of type ApplicationContext (and other spring types.)  This means it&#39;s impossible to instantiate CXFServlet without Spring on the classpath and if you add Spring to the classpath so you can instantiate CXFServlet then it will only attempt to configure itself via Spring.  <br/>
<br/>

  </td>
