</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                @Resource private WebServiceContext context  can&#39;t be injected when using the spring transaction enhancement
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
