                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Here the parts of the spring configuration file<br/>
&lt;bean id=&quot;userService&quot; parent=&quot;txProxyTemplate&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;property name=&quot;target&quot;&gt;<br/>
			&lt;bean<br/>
				class=&quot;test.UserServiceImpl&quot;<br/>
				autowire=&quot;byName&quot; /&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/property&gt;<br/>
&lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;userWebService&quot; implementor=&quot;#userService&quot;<br/>
		address=&quot;/userWebService&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I can&#39;t read any context in the test.UserServiceImpl even I declare the @Resource private WebServiceContext context  in it.<br/>
But when I removed the txProxyTemplate from userService , I got the context in test.UserServiceImpl. 
  </td>
