                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Now, in JCABusFactory, we create the polling thread directly and using the daemon mode. <br/>
1. According to JCA 1.5 spec, it would be better for us to delegate this thread to app server&#39;s WorkManager. Do not create thread in the Resource Adapter directly.<br/>
2. Write a adapter, so that Jetty is able to use the App servers ThreadPool instead of jetty its own.
  </td>
