                <tr id="issuerow12380114" rel="12380114" data-issuekey="CXF-1100" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1100" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1100">CXF-1100</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WS-RM should stream the messages into storage instead of using byte[]
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Oct/07 21:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Mar/11 01:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Currently, WS-RM loads the entire message into a byte[] to put into the RMMessage.  For large messages that could be a lot of memory used.   Ideally, it should be able to stream directly from the CachedOutputStream.getInputStream() into storage so if the message is cached in a temp file, it won&#39;t be totally loaded into memory.<br/>

  </td>
