                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If a parameter of an operation is declared as <br/>
<br/>
void foo (String x, Name[] y)<br/>
<br/>
then the resulting WSDL will look like:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xsd:complexType name=&quot;addNameBatch&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot;  name=&quot;indexid&quot; type=&quot;xsd:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:element maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot;  name=&quot;names&quot; type=&quot;ns1:ArrayOfName&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Presto: a two-dimensional array.<br/>
<br/>
Using List&lt;Name&gt; instead yields the correct schema.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
