<br/>
We will get the NPE which likes this.<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at<br/>
org.apache.cxf.binding.soap.interceptor.SoapOutInterceptor.writeSoapEnvelopeStart(SoapOutInterceptor.java:94)<br/>
