                <tr id="issuerow12380400" rel="12380400" data-issuekey="CXF-1111" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1111" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1111">CXF-1111</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                For samples, upgrade to a Servlet 2.4-compatible deployment descriptor
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Oct/07 07:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Dec/11 16:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/11 15:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.5.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Samples            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the simple &quot;fromwsdl&quot; example[1] used by Sun&#39;s JAXWS-RI, they are using a Servlet 2.4 compatible web.xml deployment descriptor[2].<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m noticing we just have a 2.3-compliant web.xml file[3]--perhaps it is time to upgrade.<br/>
<br/>
