                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If a wsdl query is done on a service that is supporting default servant delegates. The soap:address location returned in WSDL is incorrect.<br/>
<br/>
Here is how to reproduce:<br/>
<br/>
Run Server from cxf  factory_pattern system test.<br/>
<br/>
issue the queries in the following sequence. First 2 queries will return correct url but for rest of the sequence soap:address location will be same as the 2nd query.<br/>
<br/>
Here is the sequence.<br/>
<br/>
http://localhost:9006/NumberFactoryService/NumberFactoryPort?wsdl<br/>
http://localhost:9006/NumberFactoryService/NumberFactoryPort/20?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
http://localhost:9006/NumberFactoryService/NumberFactoryPort/22?wsdl<br/>
http://localhost:9006/NumberFactoryService/NumberFactoryPort/20?wsdl<br/>
http://localhost:9006/NumberFactoryService/NumberFactoryPort?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
