                <tr id="issuerow12380623" rel="12380623" data-issuekey="CXF-1116" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1116" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1116">CXF-1116</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                1-dimentional arrays appear as 2-dimentional in the wsdl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tawfik Lachheb
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tawfik Lachheb
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Oct/07 17:50 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Dec/07 19:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Oct/07 18:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Aegis Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We are trying to publish interfaces using the simple frontend with aegis.  We are seeing that any method that returns an array does not appear correctly in the wsdl.  For example, if a method returns a String[], the return appears in the wsdl as:<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
  &lt;xsd:element maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;return&quot; type=&quot;tns:ArrayOfString&quot; /&gt; <br/>
  &lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
<br/>
which represents a 2-dimentional array because of the maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
This is a show-stopper for us.  If a fix is made, we are willing to use a snapshot build until a release happens.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks
  </td>
