                <tr id="issuerow12381261" rel="12381261" data-issuekey="CXF-1145" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1145" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1145">CXF-1145</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Not able to set the namespace for a service wsdl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tawfik Lachheb
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tawfik Lachheb
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Oct/07 16:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Dec/07 19:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Nov/07 15:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We are trying to upgrade our published services from xfire to cxf using the simple frontend with aegis.  When we set the namespace for classes in the service&#39;s object model the namespaces appear ok.  The problem is that the namespace of the service class is auto-generated and becasue it does not match what we set for the object model, it causes issues with some client SOAP toolkits.<br/>
<br/>
In xfire, we used to be able to set the service namespace by doing something like this:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;bean id=&quot;...&quot; class=&quot;org.codehaus.xfire.spring.remoting.XFireExporter&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;property name=&quot;namespace&quot; ref=&quot;nameSpace&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        ...<br/>
    &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This capability does not seem to be available in cxf.<br/>
We have tried setting the namespace in the service aegis file with no success.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks
  </td>
