                <tr id="issuerow12381501" rel="12381501" data-issuekey="CXF-1155" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1155" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1155">CXF-1155</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Parameters are not all processed if non ordered as parts...
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Lucas Lampietti
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Lucas Lampietti
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Oct/07 23:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/09 19:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Oct/09 18:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Parts are read only one time with the iterator in DocLiteralInInterceptor.getPara(), creating an uncomplete list in case of non ordered parameters.<br/>
I think a temporary list of parts should be used by getPara() in place of an iterator, remove the part from this temporary list when parameter matched, and then redo the loop from beginning of this list.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
