                <tr id="issuerow12381540" rel="12381540" data-issuekey="CXF-1158" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1158" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1158">CXF-1158</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                configurability of endpoint rewrting
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Vest Hansen
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Vest Hansen
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Oct/07 10:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Dec/07 19:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 01/Nov/07 18:41 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I deploy a CXF web service to a cluster that sits behind a content switch.<br/>
<br/>
We have HTTPS on the content switch for security, but internally in<br/>
the cluster we use plain HTTP for speed.<br/>
<br/>
Now, CXF has a habit of rewriting my carefully crafted endpoint URLs<br/>
in my WSDL, thus reporting plain HTTP endpoints on the services/ page<br/>
and in the final WSDL, when in fact they should be HTTPS.<br/>
<br/>
What I&#39;de like is an attribute on the jaxws:endpoint element, could be a<br/>
boolean &#39;rewriteUrl&#39; that defaults to true, so that I can disable this <br/>
functionality and thereby force CXF to use the endpoint url in verbatim <br/>
from the WSDL.
  </td>
