                <tr id="issuerow12381555" rel="12381555" data-issuekey="CXF-1161" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1161" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1161">CXF-1161</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Javadoc for classes generated XSD with WSDL is defective
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sean O&#39;Callaghan
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Oct/07 14:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Aug/09 20:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Jul/09 18:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.6,                     2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve added a &#39;form_test.xsd&#39; file to the test resources for rt/databinding/jaxb. This contains:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:complexType name=&quot;ObjectWithQualifiedElement&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
            &lt;xs:element name=&quot;string1&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;xs:element name=&quot;string2&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot; form=&#39;qualified&#39; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The javadoc in the generated class lacks the form attribute.<br/>
<br/>
&lt;complexType name=&quot;ObjectWithQualifiedElement&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;complexContent&gt;<br/>
     &lt;restriction base=&quot;{http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema}anyType&quot;&gt;<br/>
       &lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
         &lt;element name=&quot;string1&quot; type=&quot;{http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema}string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
         &lt;element name=&quot;string2&quot; type=&quot;{http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema}string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
       &lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
     &lt;/restriction&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/complexContent&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
