                                            <td class="description">      validation with no warning suppression cause wsdl2java from maven-code-gen to blow with Error Warning for logical wsdl. That is wsdl that has no services defined. Having suppressWarnings on by default in the WSDLToJavaContaner fixes this.<br/>
