                <tr id="issuerow12382027" rel="12382027" data-issuekey="CXF-1184" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1184" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1184">CXF-1184</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Enable &#39;defaultMinOccurs&#39; and &#39;defaultNillable&#39; on Simple Server
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Kaleb Walton
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Kaleb Walton
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Nov/07 17:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/09 17:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Nov/07 18:30 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0,                     2.0.1,                     2.0.2,                     2.0.3,                     2.1,                     Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Bus,                     Configuration,                     Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The only drawback we have found to using the simple server is that primitives are by default set to minOccurs=&quot;1&quot; making them required. This is not desirable - if we simply had a &#39;defaultMinOccurs&#39; flag we could set it would allow us to control that ourselves, even if it was as the global level it would enable us to have a clean, completely decoupled use of CXF.
  </td>
