                <tr id="issuerow12382033" rel="12382033" data-issuekey="CXF-1185" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1185" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1185">CXF-1185</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Should Java REST annotations (JRA) values be incorporated within CXF (instead of codehaus)?
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Nov/07 19:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/09 17:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Jan/08 02:55 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Team,  presently our JRA annotations[1] apparently are incorporated from XFire&#39;s annotations--see here[2] and Example #14 here[3].  I&#39;m not sure, but I wonder if we should switch the following annotations to a CXF package:<br/>
