                <tr id="issuerow12382324" rel="12382324" data-issuekey="CXF-1200" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1200" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1200">CXF-1200</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wsdltojava accepts targetnamespace with &#39;:&#39; in the name but generate code that does not compile
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            maomaode
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Nov/07 08:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Aug/15 12:36 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Feb/08 19:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-6527                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">       When using following target namespace with &#39;:&#39; in it (&quot;targetNamespace of http://blahblah:8080/nasoap/services/urn:nasoap-server2), the generated code by &quot;wsdltojava&quot; will contain a java package name with &#39;:&#39; on it, which will fail at compilation. <br/>
<br/>
&quot;The reason I am saying it is a bug is that schemavalidator does not complain about it, even if it is an invalid URL format.<br/>
Even wsdltojava does not complain, but generates uncompilable code.<br/>
So I think the fix should be put in schemavalidator to flag this as an error. &quot;
  </td>
