</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If the wsdl has an out of band header that is an in/out header, and the code is NOT generated with -exsh true, the HolderOutInterceptor tries to process the header part even though it isn&#39;t there thus causing an exception.<br/>
<br/>

