                <tr id="issuerow12382384" rel="12382384" data-issuekey="CXF-1204" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1204" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1204">CXF-1204</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Dynamic client does not filter out JDK packages....
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Nov/07 21:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Jul/08 17:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/May/08 19:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.1,                     2.0.2,                     2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.1,                     2.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      With http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/eutils/soap/eutils_lite.wsdl, the Dynamic client tries to pass &quot;java.lang&quot; to the JAXB context.<br/>
<br/>
The dynamic client should:<br/>
<br/>
1) Filter out the known packages ahead of time (java.lang, java.util, etc..)<br/>
<br/>
2) Check each package for pacakge.ObjectFactory and only use the packages where one is found.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
