                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                xjc dv plugin doesn&#39;t provide default values for complexTypes that contain elements
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Test</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
