  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I created a test case to test this situation:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;xs:complexType name=&quot;pageColor&quot;&gt;<br/>
    	&lt;xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
    		&lt;xs:element name=&quot;background&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot; default=&quot;red&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    		&lt;xs:element name=&quot;foreground&quot; type=&quot;xs:string&quot; default=&quot;blue&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    	&lt;/xs:sequence&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/xs:complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:element name=&quot;pageColor&quot; type=&quot;tns:pageColor&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/xs:element&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The defaults values are never set.
