</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      JAX-RS demo does not work when a resouce method returns String, See below:<br/>
<br/>
   @javax.ws.rs.HttpMethod(&quot;GET&quot;)<br/>
   @javax.ws.rs.UriTemplate(&quot;{section}/{id}&quot;)<br/>
   public String findBySectionAndId(@javax.ws.rs.UriParam(&quot;section&quot;)<br/>
   String section, @javax.ws.rs.UriParam(&quot;id&quot;)<br/>
   String id) {<br/>
       return &quot;Hello World - section is &quot; + section + &quot;, id is &quot; + id + &quot;\n&quot;;<br/>
   }<br/>
<br/>
FWIW I had to change type of the &quot;Id&quot; parameter from an int to a String not to throw a IllegalArgumentException<br/>

  </td>
