                <tr id="issuerow12383702" rel="12383702" data-issuekey="CXF-1245" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1245" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1245">CXF-1245</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Thread hangs when processing response message using LocalTransport with dispatchDirect
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Coogan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Coogan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Dec/07 13:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Jan/08 21:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Dec/07 20:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When running requests on a local transport configured with DISPATCH_DIRECT = true, small request/response messages process successfully but any request that generates a response &gt; 1KB seems to hang the JVM. The problem appears to be in the PipedInput/OutputStreams. If the buffer (default size 1024B) fills up it is never flushed and the thread appears to hang in an eternal wait (PipedInputStream.awaitSpace())<br/>
<br/>
The PipedInput and PipedOutput Streams are on the same thread and therefore the buffer is never cleared until after the stream is closed. Pipes should never be used on a single thread. That will definitely cause a hang. Possibly should use a CachedOutputStream and then grab the inputstream in the dispatchDirect method. 
  </td>
