                                            <td class="description">      At the moment you need to have a resource method only marked with @UriTemplate (no     @HttpMethod(&quot;&quot;) annotation). This tells jax-rs runtime this resource class has subResources. I.e.:<br/>
<br/>
    //FIXME: wont work if remove this method, has to set hasSubResource to true<br/>
    @UriTemplate(&quot;/anyURLWilldo&quot;)<br/>
    public String anyMethodNameWillDo() {<br/>
        return null;<br/>
    }<br/>
<br/>

