                <tr id="issuerow12384440" rel="12384440" data-issuekey="CXF-1291" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1291" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1291">CXF-1291</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Create an interceptor to strip XML namespaces....
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Dec/07 22:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/Aug/11 14:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/May/11 14:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
A couple of folks on cxf-user have asked for the ability to return XML with all the namespaces completely stripped out.   <br/>
<br/>
<br/>
An &quot;interesting&quot; approach could be to add an interceptor immediately after the StaxOutInterceptor that would wrapper the  XMLStreamWriter with a writer that would discard all namespace related events.  We just need the interceptor to be created.   Adding it can be a configuration item for the user.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
