                <tr id="issuerow12384765" rel="12384765" data-issuekey="CXF-1307" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1307" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1307">CXF-1307</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wsdl2java creates overwrites Adapter when using different jaxws:bindings for diferent wsdls
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eugenio Marchiori
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eugenio Marchiori
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Dec/07 13:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:57 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Dec/09 02:42 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      using maven plugin, on a windows system
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When generating java code form wsdl files, if a different binding file is specified for each, the wsdl2java only creates one &quot;Adapter1&quot; class that overwrites the previous one, thus using the incorrect class for conversion.<br/>
I haven&#39;t found a workaround yet, besides modifing the generated code. I need this because I have to use two diferente webservices that use diferent coding for the date, and need diferente DateFormats for each.<br/>
I think the code shoud be modified in a way that when an Adapter already exists, and a new one must be created, it gets a new name.
  </td>
