                                            <td class="description">      Refactor callback demo to reflect the change of EndpointReference in jax-ws 2.1:<br/>
<br/>
1. in Client.java, we should not build EndpointReferenceType by ourselves, instead we should use Endpoint.getEndpointReference to acquire an EndpointReference instance from the published endpoint.<br/>
<br/>
2. Replace EndpointReferenceType (which is CXF internal type) with the W3CEndpointReference type which is defined by the spec.
