</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF2.0.3 rejects wrapped array parameters when they have whitespace or comments
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
