  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If webparam is an array, for example, a string array: <br/>
<br/>
  @WebMethod(operationName = &quot;SendData&quot;, action = &quot;&quot;)<br/>
    @WebResult(name = &quot;result&quot;, targetNamespace = &quot;http://service.host.webservices.nortel.com&quot;)<br/>
    public String hostSendData(<br/>
    					@WebParam(name = &quot;params&quot;) String[] strs);<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
will get the following CXF exceptions. However, I tried xfire1.2.6, it works fine.<br/>
<br/>
10:45:23,092 ERROR [STDERR] Dec 24, 2007 10:45:23 AM org.apache.cxf.interceptor.LoggingInInterceptor handleMessage<br/>
