                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The overrideTypes feature of Aegis is not working for inputs. While the type is registered, it isn&#39;t in the right place, since it isn&#39;t in the correct xml2Type map to be seen when reading a message over the wire.<br/>
<br/>
I observed this in 2.1/trunk using JavaScript cases. I&#39;m about to go create a test case purely in the Aegis tree with the goal of making a fix that could apply to 2.0.4.<br/>

