  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I tried to run sample application &quot;fromwsdl&quot; from jwsdp-2.0 using CXF. Classes are generated using wsdl2java tool. <br/>
Service is running correctly, but something is wrong with unmarschalling parameters from request message.<br/>
Both parameters of method &quot;addNumbers&quot; are always 0.<br/>
Message looks like this:<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
   &lt;ns1:addNumbers xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://duke.org/&quot;&gt;<br/>
     &lt;arg0 xmlns=&quot;http://duke.org/&quot;&gt;1&lt;/arg0&gt;<br/>
     &lt;arg1 xmlns=&quot;http://duke.org/&quot;&gt;2&lt;/arg1&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/ns1:addNumbers&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;
  </td>
