                <tr id="issuerow12386152" rel="12386152" data-issuekey="CXF-1391" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1391" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1391">CXF-1391</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                First object in Aegis array of anyType items has no xsi:type
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Jan/08 19:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/08 14:57 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Jan/08 21:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Aegis Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The Javascript Aegis test has a case in which the response looks like the following. Note the missing xsi:type on the first element, as well as the extra xsd prefix.<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ns1:returnBeanWithAnyTypeArrayResponse xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://fortest.javascript.cxf.apache.org/&quot;&gt;<br/>
         &lt;ns1:return&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ns2:objects xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://aegis.fortest.javascript.cxf.apache.org&quot;&gt;<br/>
               &lt;ns3:anyType xmlns:ns3=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/arrays&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;ns2:name&gt;shrew&lt;/ns2:name&gt;<br/>
               &lt;/ns3:anyType&gt;<br/>
               &lt;ns3:anyType ns4:type=&quot;xsd:int&quot; xmlns:ns3=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/arrays&quot; xmlns:xsd=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema&quot; xmlns:ns4=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;42&lt;/ns3:anyType&gt;<br/>
               &lt;ns3:anyType ns4:type=&quot;ns2:Vegetable&quot; xmlns:ns3=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/arrays&quot; xmlns:ns4=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;ns2:family&gt;brasica&lt;/ns2:family&gt;<br/>
               &lt;/ns3:anyType&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/ns2:objects&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ns2:string xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://aegis.fortest.javascript.cxf.apache.org&quot;&gt;lima&lt;/ns2:string&gt;<br/>
