                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      While there is code that is intended to do MTOM in Aegis, it doesn&#39;t work.<br/>
<br/>
Issues:<br/>
<br/>
1) The code assumes that for DataHandler, MTOM will always happen, whether or not &#39;mtom is enabled&#39;. Should it throw, or do something else, if MTOM is not enabled?<br/>
<br/>
2) The code is broken. <br/>
<br/>
3) There is no way to control the mime type associated with a data handler.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
