                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The code to notice the @MTOM annotation was in the endpoint instead of in the jaxws server factory. So it didn&#39;t run for jaxws:service, so MTOM was disabled for content leaving the server for the client.<br/>
