                <tr id="issuerow12387251" rel="12387251" data-issuekey="CXF-1407" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1407" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1407">CXF-1407</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Item element with xmlns=&quot;&quot; in Exception with arrays of compex objects
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Marco Piraccini
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Marco Piraccini
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Jan/08 20:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Nov/09 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Oct/09 20:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux, java1.6.0_02
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Consider an exception with an array of objects. If  i send a soap message:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:ser=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soapenv:Header/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ser:sayHi&gt;<br/>
         &lt;ser:arg0&gt;test&lt;/ser:arg0&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/ser:sayHi&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soapenv:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soapenv:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The answer is:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   (...)<br/>
            &lt;ns1:ComplexException xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot;&gt;<br/>
               &lt;reason xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot;&gt;Test&lt;/reason&gt;<br/>
               &lt;beans xsi:type=&quot;ns2:myBeanArray&quot; xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;item&gt;<br/>
                     &lt;ns2:age&gt;0&lt;/ns2:age&gt;<br/>
                     &lt;ns2:name&gt;Marco&lt;/ns2:name&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/item&gt;<br/>
               &lt;/beans&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/ns1:ComplexException&gt;<br/>
(...)<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Notice that the item element is with no namespace (correct).<br/>
The problem is that, after the first soap message sent, if i request the service wsdl (for example pointing the browser at http://localhost:9000/helloWorld?wsdl), all the subsequent answers are with a different (and wrong) response:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
(...)<br/>
            &lt;ns1:ComplexException xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot;&gt;<br/>
               &lt;reason xmlns=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot;&gt;Test&lt;/reason&gt;<br/>
               &lt;beans xsi:type=&quot;myBeanArray&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;item xmlns=&quot;&quot; xmlns:ns3=&quot;http://server.hw.demo/&quot;&gt;<br/>
                     &lt;ns3:age&gt;0&lt;/ns3:age&gt;<br/>
                     &lt;ns3:name&gt;Marco&lt;/ns3:name&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/item&gt;<br/>
               &lt;/beans&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/ns1:ComplexException&gt;<br/>
(...)<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
In the attachment there is a simple project to reproduce the problem.<br/>
<br/>
Marco.<br/>

