                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In a out interceptor for a server response, if i populate a JMS header in the JMS_SERVER_RESPONSE headers. I do not get it back in the JMS_CLIENT_RESPONSE headers. <br/>
<br/>
It looks like when handling the output message in JMSDestination, the JMS_SERVER_RESPONSE is got from the inMessage instead of the outMessage. I have attached a patch for fixing this issue.
