                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/08 14:57 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Feb/08 20:42 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">14400</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">14400</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Enhancement to allow a list of custom providers be specified for a spring configured JAX-RS server. Syntax as below:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxrs:server id=&quot;bookservice&quot;<br/>
		        address=&quot;/&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;jaxrs:serviceBeans&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ref bean=&quot;bookstore&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/jaxrs:serviceBeans&gt;<br/>
    &lt;jaxrs:entityProviders&gt;<br/>
			&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.JAXBElementProvider&quot;/&gt;<br/>
			&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.StringProvider&quot;/&gt;<br/>
			&lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.provider.BadgerFishProvider&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/jaxrs:entityProviders&gt;		   <br/>
  &lt;/jaxrs:server&gt;<br/>
  &lt;bean id=&quot;bookstore&quot; scope=&quot;prototype&quot; class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.systest.jaxrs.BookStore&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This list will overwrite the default Entity Provider list and will be ordered as usual.<br/>

  </td>
