                <tr id="issuerow12388769" rel="12388769" data-issuekey="CXF-1436" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1436" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1436">CXF-1436</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Error in WS-Security 1.1 Signature Confirmation handling
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Colm O hEigeartaigh
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Feb/08 15:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/08 15:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Feb/08 19:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
WS-Security 1.1 Signature Confirmation is a mechanism whereby a receiver of a signed SOAP message attaches a &quot;SignatureConfirmation&quot; blob in the responding SOAP message containing the signature that was received. In this way the initiator knows that the signature was received correctly.<br/>
<br/>
In CXF, support for signature confirmation is provided via the WSS4J*Interceptors. However, there&#39;s a minor boolean bug in the WSS4JOutInterceptor that mixes up the roles of the requestor and the responder, and hence this feature is broken.<br/>
<br/>
See attached patch for fix and unit test.
  </td>
