                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      AttachmentDeserializer appears to be leaving behind temp files. Every time &quot;cache&quot; is called, it creates a new temp file with IOUtils.copy (line 228). This file is never deleted. It looks like there&#39;s a hook so it should get deleted if the inputStream is closed, but the inputStream is never closed.
  </td>
