                                            <td class="description">      public class Foo<br/>
{<br/>
  Foo(){}<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
@WebService<br/>
public interface IWebService<br/>
{<br/>
  public callFoo(@WebParam (header=true) Foo aFoo);<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
By virtue of the constructor of class Foo being non-public, the java2wsdl tool throws a NullPointerException.  At the very least, a more useful message would be outstanding.  Base case would allow this package visibility to be accepted by the tool.  Note that the tool completes successfully when the header annotation is left out.<br/>
<br/>
