                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2048                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      HTTPS web service call fails from webapp deployed in ear file to BEA 9.2 with following error:<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.ClassCastException: weblogic.net.http.SOAPHttpsURLConnection<br/>
   at org.apache.cxf.transport.https.HttpsURLConnectionFactory.createConnection(HttpsURLConnectionFactory.java:120)<br/>
<br/>
My weblogic-application.xml contains:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;prefer-application-packages&gt;<br/>
   &lt;package-name&gt;javax.jws.*&lt;/package-name&gt;<br/>
&lt;/prefer-application-packages&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The secure web service call works in Tomcat 5.5.<br/>

