                <tr id="issuerow12390171" rel="12390171" data-issuekey="CXF-1461" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1461" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1461">CXF-1461</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                XML tag letter case
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Mark Bryant
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Mark Bryant
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Mar/08 13:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/May/09 19:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Dec/08 16:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Use with JBOss, Spring Framework, Windows environment
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to use REST services with CXF.  When using a POST to a Java object, all works fine when the XML markup paseed via the POST begins with a lower case letter.  However, when it begins with an upper case letter, the values are not mapped to my Java object.  For example, if the XML passed is like: <br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;Part&gt;<br/>
	&lt;Number&gt;152334&lt;/Number&gt;<br/>
&lt;/Part&gt;<br/>
<br/>
nothing gets mapped, but when it is:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;part&gt;<br/>
	&lt;number&gt;152334&lt;/number&gt;<br/>
&lt;/part&gt;<br/>
<br/>
all works OK.<br/>
<br/>
I have tried changing the case of my annotations and Java object variables, but this doesn&#39;t solve the problem.  I am using CXF 2.0.4.<br/>

  </td>
