                <tr id="issuerow12391452" rel="12391452" data-issuekey="CXF-1477" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1477" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1477">CXF-1477</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Integrate somehow with Hibernate to avoid LazyInitializationException errors
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Leandro
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Leandro
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Mar/08 14:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Oct/11 17:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Aug/11 20:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Bus            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ubuntu Feisty Fawn (7.04)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using Hibernate as a DAO layer will end in LazyInitializationException errors.<br/>
I&#39;ve tried to define OpenSessionInView filter and mapping it to the same address as the web service, but with no luck.<br/>
<br/>
The current workaround is to set the collection with the property lazy=&quot;false&quot;, which is not the best solution.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll try to build a tiny example to demonstrate it.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
