                <tr id="issuerow12392054" rel="12392054" data-issuekey="CXF-1485" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1485" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1485">CXF-1485</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                @WebParam / @WebResult partName parameter ignored when @SOAPBinding parameterStyle=BARE
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Evgeny V. Chesnokov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Evgeny V. Chesnokov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Mar/08 15:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/09 19:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/09 14:45 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Here&#39;s my annotated method:<br/>
    @WebMethod @WebResult(partName=&quot;exists&quot;, name = &quot;exists&quot;)<br/>
    @ResponseWrapper(className = &quot;java.lang.Boolean&quot;) @RequestWrapper(className = &quot;java.lang.Long&quot;)<br/>
    @SOAPBinding(parameterStyle = SOAPBinding.ParameterStyle.BARE)<br/>
    public boolean checkBICSwiftExists(@WebParam(partName=&quot;bicId&quot;, name = &quot;bicId&quot;) long bicId);<br/>
<br/>
This results in the following WSDL:<br/>
...<br/>
  &lt;xs:element name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExists&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:long&quot; /&gt; <br/>
  &lt;xs:element name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExistsResponse&quot; nillable=&quot;true&quot; type=&quot;xs:boolean&quot; /&gt; <br/>
...<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:operation name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExists&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:input message=&quot;tns:checkBICSwiftExists&quot; name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExists&quot; /&gt; <br/>
  &lt;wsdl:output message=&quot;tns:checkBICSwiftExistsResponse&quot; name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExistsResponse&quot; /&gt; <br/>
  &lt;/wsdl:operation&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:message name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExists&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:part element=&quot;tns:checkBICSwiftExists&quot; name=&quot;parameters&quot; /&gt;  &lt;!-- here is the wrong part, name should be &quot;bicId&quot; ! --&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/wsdl:message&gt;<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:message name=&quot;checkBICSwiftExistsResponse&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:part element=&quot;tns:checkBICSwiftExistsResponse&quot; name=&quot;parameters&quot; /&gt;   &lt;!-- here is the wrong part, name should be &quot;exists&quot; ! --&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/wsdl:message&gt;<br/>
<br/>
That, when wsdl2java is called, results in wrong parameter name, i.e. &quot;long parameters&quot;.<br/>
<br/>
Hope that helps, bye,<br/>
Evgeny.
  </td>
