                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The cleaning up tasks of BindingOperations and BindingFaults during the stopServer() callback in PolicyEngine, is not threadsafe. We take an iterator over the clientRequestInfo map keyset, clientResponseMap, serverRequestInfo, serverResponseInfo, clientFaultInfo, serverFaultInfo etc and do a map.remove() which would lead to synchronization issues.
