                <tr id="issuerow12393283" rel="12393283" data-issuekey="CXF-1505" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1505" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1505">CXF-1505</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Problem parsing /schemas/xmldsig-core-schema.xsd (Issue CXF-1200)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Diego Jarillo
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Diego Jarillo
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Apr/08 08:25 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Jul/16 00:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 01/Nov/09 14:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">6</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      JBoss 4..0.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
My server (JBoss 4.0.5) don´t has internet conection. I am using CXF 2.0.4. In the wsdl i have<br/>
<br/>
