                <tr id="issuerow12393712" rel="12393712" data-issuekey="CXF-1523" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1523" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1523">CXF-1523</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Reopen Bug CXF-1448: Aegis + SAAJ leads to namespace complaint.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Weikuo Liaw
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Weikuo Liaw
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Apr/08 01:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/08 14:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Apr/08 16:58 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Aegis Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      WebLogic
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I still get the exception with version CXF 2.0.5 in WebLogic. I found out that:<br/>
The previous fix of CXF-1448 does not fix the problem for empty namespaces, because the fix only checks for &quot;namespace != null&quot; but not checks for &quot;namespace.length() &gt; 0&quot;.
