                                            <td class="description">      when jaxws:endpoint is craeted with wsdlLocation attribute, then result of endpointname?wsdl is wsdl with these differences from original wsdl:<br/>
- CDATA sections markers are missing in wsdl:documentation elements, which efectivelly breaks formating of documentation in lots of wsdl viewers and also in javadoc after using wsdl2java of various WS stacks.<br/>
<br/>
note that special character &amp; was replaced with &amp;amp; (this replacement shouldn&#39;t be done if CDATA is used)
