                                            <td class="description">      WIth a JAX-WS Client,When the following code is used to retrieve the attachment part of the SOAP message.It always returns Null.Looks like the attachment part of the soap message is never being set in the context MAP.<br/>
<br/>
BindingProvider bp = (BindingProvider)port;<br/>
<br/>
java.util.Map&lt;String,Object&gt; responseContext =bp.getResponseContext();<br/>
<br/>
(Map&lt;String,List&lt;String&gt;&gt;)responseContext.get(MessageContext.INBOUND_MESSAGE_ATTACHMENTS)<br/>
<br/>

