                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the current snapshot build, I received runtime errors about missing abdera classes when I set CXF up to handle JSON/REST messages.<br/>
<br/>
I fixed the problem by adding the following to my project&#39;s pom.xml:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
            &lt;!-- needed bacause the cxf folks messed up and forgot a dependency --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.abdera&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifactId&gt;abdera-i18n&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
            &lt;version&gt;0.4.0-incubating&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>

  </td>
