                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Configurer.DEFAULT_USER_CFG_FILE is = &quot;cxf.xml&quot;<br/>
<br/>
under osgi, at least, this causes the resource not to load in BusApplicationContext.getConfigResources<br/>
<br/>
should be META-INF/cxf/cxf.xml<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Luckily this is overridden from a system property, but it might want to be addressed.
