		Error location: wsdl:definitions / wsdl:binding / wsdl:operation / soap:operation<br/>
<br/>
File C:\Programs\CXF\21\src\tools\validator\target\test-classes\validator_wsdl\hello_world_schema_import.wsdl is not valid.<br/>
	attribute &#39;element&#39; in message part &#39;in&#39; (message &#39;sayHiRequest&#39;) refers to element &#39;x1:sayHi&#39; which is not defined within the WSDL file!<br/>
		Error location: wsdl:definitions / wsdl:message / wsdl:part / @element<br/>
<br/>
Other schemas fail to validate but don&#39;t cause test failures: bp2717, jms_test, header_rpc_lit, header_rpc_lit_2203_in, header_rpc_lit_2203_out.<br/>
