                <tr id="issuerow12395168" rel="12395168" data-issuekey="CXF-1567" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1567" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1567">CXF-1567</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                DynamicClientFactory throws NullPointerException while building classpath if jar does not have Manifest file
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alton Idowu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alton Idowu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/May/08 23:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Jul/08 17:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/May/08 18:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.1,                     2.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      JDK 1.5.0_09, Tomcat 5.5.20, Ubuntu 7.04, Windows XP
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      While attempting to  use the following code snippet:<br/>
<br/>
DynamicClientFactory dcf = DynamicClientFactory.newInstance();<br/>
Client client = dcf.createClient(wsdlUrl);<br/>
<br/>
The factory throws a NullPointerException without a helpuful stack trace. The issue was caused by a jar file that did not have a manifest file.  <br/>
<br/>
    static void addClasspathFromManifest(StringBuilder classPath, File file) <br/>
        throws URISyntaxException, IOException {<br/>
        <br/>
        JarFile jar = new JarFile(file);<br/>
        Attributes attr = jar.getManifest().getMainAttributes();<br/>
                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^<br/>
<br/>
The following code should fix the issue:<br/>
<br/>
      Attributes attr = null;<br/>
      if (jar.getManifest() != null) {<br/>
        attr = jar.getManifest().getMainAttributes();<br/>
      }<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
