                                            <td class="description">          public void writeCacheTo(StringBuilder out, int limit) throws IOException {<br/>
    ...<br/>
                if ((count + x) &gt; limit) {<br/>
                    x = count - limit;                               &lt;&lt;&lt; this has to be:    x = limit - count;<br/>
                }<br/>
                out.append(new String(bytes, 0, x));<br/>
                count += x;<br/>
    ...<br/>
    }<br/>
<br/>
If limit is reached x becomes negative and String construction fails with<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.StringIndexOutOfBoundsException: String index out of range: -784<br/>
	at java.lang.String.checkBounds(String.java:368)<br/>
	at java.lang.String.&lt;init&gt;(String.java:457)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.io.CachedOutputStream.writeCacheTo(CachedOutputStream.java:272)
