                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When MessageExchange contains no fault but error this code causes NPE:<br/>
<br/>
NormalizedMessage outMsg = ((InOut)xchng).getOutMessage();<br/>
Source content = null;<br/>
if (outMsg != null) {<br/>
        content = outMsg.getContent();<br/>
} else {<br/>
        content = ((InOut)xchng).getFault().getContent();<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
There should be some checking for error if there is no fault present.
