                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m about to commit a org.apache.cxf.systest.jaxws.JaxWsDynamicClientTest test. It is @Ignored, since it fails. It fails, apparently, because wsdl4j can&#39;t handle it&#39;s WSDL. The wsdl has a part with a type=&#39;xsd:base64Binary&#39;, but wsdl4j coughs up a null string for the type. <br/>
<br/>
Do we build a complex workaround involving parsing the wsdl for ourselves?<br/>
<br/>

