                <tr id="issuerow12396877" rel="12396877" data-issuekey="CXF-1613" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1613" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1613">CXF-1613</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Microsoft Reporting Services Requests support
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sergey Pulyaev
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sergey Pulyaev
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/May/08 12:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Jul/08 17:22 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Jun/08 17:22 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP Pro, MS SQL Server 2005, Apache CXF 2.0.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      http://forums.microsoft.com/msdn/ShowPost.aspx?PostID=3399523&amp;SiteID=1<br/>
<br/>
Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I am using MS Sql Server Reporting Services with web services written in java.<br/>
<br/>
Here is my query:<br/>
<br/>
Code Snippet<br/>
<br/>
&lt;Query&gt;<br/>
  &lt;Method Namespace=&quot;http://test.com/&quot; Name=&quot;getLoggedActivity&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;Parameters&gt;<br/>
    &lt;Parameter Name=&quot;userID&quot; Type=&quot;Integer&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/Parameters&gt;<br/>
&lt;/Method&gt;<br/>
   &lt;SoapAction&gt;http://test.com/getLoggedActivity&lt;/SoapAction&gt;<br/>
       &lt;ElementPath IgnoreNamespaces=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
             getLoggedActivityResponse{}/return{Date(Date),Purchaser}<br/>
       &lt;/ElementPath&gt;<br/>
&lt;/Query&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
SSRS produces following request:<br/>
<br/>
Code Snippet<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
    &lt;getLoggedActivity xmlns=&quot;http://ws.test.com/&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;userId&gt;1&lt;/userId&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/getLoggedActivity&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
But CXF waiting for the following request:<br/>
<br/>
Code Snippet<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:ws=&quot;http://ws.test.com/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ws:getLoggedActivity&gt;<br/>
         &lt;userId&gt;1&lt;/userId&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/ws:getLoggedActivity&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
In other words - in request from SQL reporting services attributes of method call obtains namespaces &quot;http://ws.test.com/&quot;  instead of empty one - and do not found by DocLiteralInInterceptor to apply as parameters of method call.<br/>
<br/>
I made a patch to support this situation.<br/>
<br/>
Best regards, Sergey
  </td>
