	at org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBEncoderDecoder.writeObject(JAXBEncoderDecoder.java:436)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.jaxb.JAXBEncoderDecoder.marshall(JAXBEncoderDecoder.java:189)<br/>
	... 26 more<br/>
Caused by: org.xml.sax.SAXParseException: cvc-pattern-valid: Value &#39;21130&#39; is not facet-valid with respect to pattern &#39;[1-2][0-9]{3}(0[1-9]|1[0-2])(0[1-9]|[1-2][0-9]|3[0-1])&#39; for type &#39;Datum&#39;.<br/>
	at com.sun.org.apache.xerces.internal.jaxp.validation.Util.toSAXParseException(Util.java:109)<br/>
