<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
To see what is wrong, i added in the service method, just before the return, the following code. <br/>
<br/>
 Class[] responseClasses = { MyResponse.class };<br/>
 JAXBContext responseContext = JAXBContext.newInstance(responseClasses);<br/>
 Marshaller responseMarshaller = responseContext.createMarshaller();<br/>
 responseMarshaller.marshal(response,System.err);<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
This produces correct XML, but non-compliant with the XSD because there is a Datum tag with a &quot;21130&quot; value.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Cheers,<br/>
- Marcel Heemskerk<br/>

