                <tr id="issuerow12397410" rel="12397410" data-issuekey="CXF-1628" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1628" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1628">CXF-1628</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                TypeCreationOptions ignored
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Bruno Braga
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Bruno Braga
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Jun/08 19:51 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Aug/08 01:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Aegis Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      java 6 update 6 + tomcat 6.0.16
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I believe that the aegis is with a bug.<br/>
<br/>
The new settings using TypeCreationOptions  are not working (or I did wrong settings and didn&#39;t show any error).<br/>
<br/>
--------------------------<br/>
        &lt;bean id=&quot;aegisBean&quot; class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.aegis.databinding.AegisDatabinding&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;property name=&quot;configuration&quot;&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.aegis.type.TypeCreationOptions&quot;&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;property name=&quot;defaultMinOccurs&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;property name=&quot;defaultNillable&quot; value=&quot;false&quot;/&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/property&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
           <br/>
        &lt;bean id=&quot;jaxws-and-aegis-service-factory&quot;<br/>
            class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxws.support.JaxWsServiceFactoryBean&quot;<br/>
            scope=&quot;prototype&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;property name=&quot;dataBinding&quot; ref=&quot;aegisBean&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
       <br/>
        &lt;bean id=&quot;segurancaService&quot; class=&quot;xxxxx.SegurancaService&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;constructor-arg&gt;&lt;ref bean=&quot;fachadaSeguranca&quot;/&gt;&lt;/constructor-arg&gt;  <br/>
        &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
       <br/>
<br/>
        &lt;jaxws:endpoint id=&quot;endpointSegurancaService&quot; implementor=&quot;#segurancaService&quot; address=&quot;/SegurancaService&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;jaxws:serviceFactory&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;ref bean=&#39;jaxws-and-aegis-service-factory&#39; /&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/jaxws:serviceFactory&gt;<br/>
            &lt;jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
              &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.binding.soap.saaj.SAAJInInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
              &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.ws.security.wss4j.WSS4JInInterceptor&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;map&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;entry key=&quot;action&quot; value=&quot;UsernameToken Timestamp&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;entry key=&quot;passwordType&quot; value=&quot;PasswordDigest&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;entry key=&quot;passwordCallbackClass&quot; value=&quot;xxxxx.wssecurity.PWCallback&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;/map&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/constructor-arg&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/bean&gt;<br/>
              &lt;bean class=&quot;xxxxx.wssecurity.UsernameTokenInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
<br/>
--------------------------<br/>
<br/>
My wsdl is being generated thus:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;idSistema&quot; type=&quot;xsd:int&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;idModulo&quot; type=&quot;xsd:int&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
<br/>
It&#39;s wrong.<br/>
minOccurs should be 1.<br/>
<br/>
TypeCreationOptions had no effect. <br/>

  </td>
