                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      At line 511 in JaxrsUtils :<br/>
<br/>
        List&lt;String&gt; results = values.get(parameterName);<br/>
        if (values != null &amp;&amp; values.size() &gt; 0) {<br/>
            result = results.get(results.size() - 1);<br/>
        }<br/>
<br/>
Looks to me like it should be :<br/>
<br/>
        List&lt;String&gt; results = values.get(parameterName);<br/>
        if (results != null &amp;&amp; results.size() &gt; 0) {<br/>
            result = results.get(results.size() - 1);<br/>
        }
  </td>
