</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF Decoupled Endpoints are not getting cleaned up properly even after bus.Shutdown() in org.apache.cxf.systest.ws.rm.SequenceTest.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
