</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am getting some test failures in ServiceMix test related to CXF  which points to lingering Decoupled endpoints started by some previous test. <br/>
So I tried org.apache.cxf.systest.ws.rm.SequenceTest from CXF Systest module and debugged it in Eclipse and see the same behaviour. If you monitor the threads each test that starts decoupled endpoint never get cleaned up and jetty therads keep listening on those ports.<br/>
<br/>
how To reproduce:<br/>
Run org.apache.cxf.systest.ws.rm.SequenceTest  from eclipse and monitor debug stack trace. You will see the list of threads running with listener on port 9999,9998,9997 ....<br/>
<br/>

