                <tr id="issuerow12398621" rel="12398621" data-issuekey="CXF-1660" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1660" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1660">CXF-1660</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Nested namespace defined spring beans aren&#39;t properly unique
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Jun/08 20:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Jul/08 14:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Jun/08 20:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.1,                     2.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.8,                     2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
With a spring config like:<br/>
  &lt;jaxws:server id=&quot;inlineSoapBinding12&quot; <br/>
    serviceClass=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxws.service.Hello&quot;<br/>
    address=&quot;http://localhost:8080/test&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;jaxws:binding&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap:soapBinding mtomEnabled=&quot;true&quot; version=&quot;1.2&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/jaxws:binding&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/jaxws:server&gt;<br/>
  <br/>
  &lt;jaxws:server id=&quot;inlineSoapBinding11&quot; <br/>
    serviceClass=&quot;org.apache.cxf.jaxws.service.Hello&quot;<br/>
    address=&quot;http://localhost:8080/testrpc&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;jaxws:binding&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap:soapBinding mtomEnabled=&quot;false&quot; version=&quot;1.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/jaxws:binding&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/jaxws:server&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Only a single &quot;SoapBindingConfiguration&quot; object is created.   Thus, the properties for the second one aren&#39;t honored.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
