                <tr id="issuerow12399121" rel="12399121" data-issuekey="CXF-1672" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1672" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1672">CXF-1672</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CXF codegen plugin creating classes with references to defunct JAXB AccessorOrder class
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Philip Schlesinger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Philip Schlesinger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Jun/08 21:36 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Jul/08 19:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 01/Jul/08 19:27 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1,                     2.0.6,                     2.1.1,                     2.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding,                     WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Kubuntu 7.10, Eclipse 3.3.2, IndexStock WSDL, Maven 2.0.9, Java version: 1.5.0_13, OS name: &quot;linux&quot; version: &quot;2.6.22-15-generic&quot; arch: &quot;i386&quot;, SpringFramework 2.5.4 (except spring-remoting, which is 2.0.8 because it apparently hasn&#39;t been caught up), CXF 2.1.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi all - hoping you can help on this one.<br/>
<br/>
WSDL: http://webservices.indexstock.com/ImageSearch/2003/07/15/imagesearch.asmx?WSDL<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m generating sources with the CXF Maven plugin.  mvn test ends up throwing an exception as it can&#39;t find the class javax/xml/bind/annotation/AccessorOrder - which apparently was released as part of jaxb-api 2.0EA3 but disappeared as soon as jaxb-api 2.0 was finalized.  Full log will be attached to this post.<br/>
<br/>
The 2.0EA3 class is available as part of the EOL&#39;d Sun JWSDP, available here:<br/>
<br/>
http://java.sun.com/webservices/downloads/previous/webservicespack.jsp<br/>
<br/>
If you unpack the download and look through the jaxb-api.jar, you&#39;ll find the AccessorOrder class<br/>
<br/>
However, as of 2.0 release, it&#39;s now XMLAccessorOrder class.  Meanwhile, maven&#39;s junit plugin is looking for AccessorOrder.<br/>
<br/>
How do I fix this?<br/>
<br/>
- Phil<br/>
<br/>
JAXB dependencies:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
				&lt;groupId&gt;javax.xml.bind&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-api&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;version&gt;2.1&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
			&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
				&lt;groupId&gt;javax.xml&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-impl&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;version&gt;2.0EA3&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
			&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
				&lt;groupId&gt;javax.xml&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-xjc&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;version&gt;2.0EA3&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Exclusions for each of the CXF dependencies in the pom because I com.sun.* makes things fail:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;exclusions&gt;<br/>
					&lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
						&lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.bind&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
						&lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-api&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/exclusion&gt;<br/>
					&lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
						&lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.bind&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
						&lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-impl&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/exclusion&gt;<br/>
					&lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
						&lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.bind&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
						&lt;artifactId&gt;jaxb-xjc&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/exclusion&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/exclusions&gt;<br/>
{code|<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
codegen plugin:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
				&lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
				&lt;version&gt;2.1.1&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
				&lt;executions&gt;<br/>
					&lt;execution&gt;<br/>
						&lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
						&lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
						&lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
							&lt;sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
								${basedir}/target/generated/src/main/java<br/>
							&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
							&lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
								&lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
									&lt;wsdl&gt;<br/>
										http://webservices.indexstock.com/ImageSearch/2003/07/15/imagesearch.asmx?WSDL<br/>
									&lt;/wsdl&gt;<br/>
								&lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
							&lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
						&lt;goals&gt;<br/>
							&lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
