                <tr id="issuerow12399448" rel="12399448" data-issuekey="CXF-1679" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1679" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1679">CXF-1679</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Schema entries with same targetNamespace produces error in wsdl2java
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andy Frantz
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andy Frantz
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Jul/08 13:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Nov/09 20:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP, Eclipse
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When running wsdl2java, If there are multiple xsd:schema entries with the same targetNamespace in the wsdl:types section, a &quot;WSDLToJava Error: Failed to create java parameter...&quot; error occurs.  I&#39;m not actually sure why the error occurs, but he wsdl validates just fine with the validation tool.<br/>
<br/>
Validates, but causes a problem in wsdl2java:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:types&gt;<br/>
  &lt;xsd:schema elementFormDefault=&quot;qualified&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;target:ns&quot; xmlns:tns=&quot;target:ns&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;xsd:include schemaLocation=&quot;../schemas/first.xsd&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/xsd:schema&gt;<br/>
  &lt;xsd:schema elementFormDefault=&quot;qualified&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;target:ns&quot; xmlns:tns=&quot;target:ns&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;xsd:include schemaLocation=&quot;../schemas/second.xsd&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/xsd:schema&gt;<br/>
&lt;/wsdl:types&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Does not cause a problem:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:types&gt;<br/>
  &lt;xsd:schema elementFormDefault=&quot;qualified&quot; targetNamespace=&quot;target:ns&quot; xmlns:tns=&quot;target:ns&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;xsd:include schemaLocation=&quot;../schemas/first.xsd&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;xsd:include schemaLocation=&quot;../schemas/second.xsd&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/xsd:schema&gt;<br/>
&lt;/wsdl:types&gt;
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
