    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1682" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1682">CXF-1682</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Generated Web service Client fails for http://demo.aws.air-worldwide.com/aws/passporttogo.asmx?wsdl
    </p>
</td>
