                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Here is the WSDL that CXF cannot handle.<br/>
http://demo.aws.air-worldwide.com/aws/passporttogo.asmx?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
If you generate a client with wsdl2java  in both latest releases of CXF you will see that it fails at runtime.<br/>
I tested the code against JAXWS-RI client and it works fine.<br/>
<br/>
This is the usecase to test;<br/>
    <br/>
<br/>
        <br/>
    public void runThis(){<br/>
        <br/>
        <br/>
try { <br/>
   com.air_worldwide.webservices.PassportToGo service = new com.air_worldwide.webservices.PassportToGo();<br/>
   com.air_worldwide.webservices.PassportToGoSoap port = service.getPassportToGoSoap();<br/>
   	<br/>
	java.lang.String xmlReqStg = str;<br/>
   <br/>
   java.lang.String result = port.getISOData(xmlReqStg);<br/>
   System.out.println(&quot;Result = &quot;+result);<br/>
} catch (Exception ex) {<br/>
   // TODO handle custom exceptions here<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
please use this following string for the parameter of the porg.getISOData( ) method<br/>
<br/>
 &quot;&lt;ISORequests&gt;&lt;RequestHeader&gt;&lt;AIR&gt;&lt;LicenseKey&gt;QLAFKIUDJ%7DLWEHAVLFEJN%60%7DWQKJ%60&lt;/LicenseKey&gt;&lt;LoginID&gt;amkeystone_ws&lt;/LoginID&gt;&lt;Password&gt;amke9919&lt;/Password&gt;&lt;/AIR&gt;&lt;Passport&gt;&lt;LoginID&gt;AARPASA#&lt;/LoginID&gt;      &lt;Password&gt;ARPASA#&lt;/Password&gt;      &lt;ResellerID&gt;33755&lt;/ResellerID&gt;&lt;OrderAccountNumber&gt;41619&lt;/OrderAccountNumber&gt;      &lt;ShipToAccountNumber&gt;41619&lt;/ShipToAccountNumber&gt;&lt;WebServiceUserID&gt;PIDAIRPASSA&lt;/WebServiceUserID&gt;      &lt;WebServicePassword&gt;k!9s!j45&lt;/WebServicePassword&gt;&lt;UserID&gt;0&lt;/UserID&gt;&lt;/Passport&gt;&lt;/RequestHeader&gt;&lt;ISORequest&gt;&lt;Products&gt;DetailPPC&lt;/Products&gt;&lt;Addresses&gt;&lt;Options parse=\&quot;yes\&quot; validateCSZ=\&quot;no\&quot; validateAddress=\&quot;yes\&quot; geocode=\&quot;yes\&quot; returnHighestScore=\&quot;yes\&quot; /&gt;&lt;Address&gt;&lt;Type&gt;UnparsedRiskAddress&lt;/Type&gt;&lt;Addr1&gt;Address 1&lt;/Addr1&gt;&lt;City&gt;City&lt;/City&gt;&lt;StateProv&gt;State&lt;/StateProv&gt;&lt;PostalCode&gt;Zip&lt;/PostalCode&gt;&lt;ZIP4/&gt;&lt;ZIPCarrierRoute/&gt;&lt;/Address&gt;&lt;/Addresses&gt;&lt;/ISORequest&gt;&lt;/ISORequests&gt; &quot;<br/>
