                                            <td class="description">      It should not be necessary to use extraargs to configure parameters named parameter should be used instead. Extraargs should remain for unusual circumstances and backwards compatibility.<br/>
<br/>
The options are configured as follows:<br/>
<br/>
					&lt;defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
						&lt;packagenames&gt;<br/>
							&lt;packagename&gt;packagename&lt;/packagename&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/packagenames&gt;<br/>
						&lt;defaultExcludesNamespace&gt;true&lt;/defaultExcludesNamespace&gt;<br/>
						&lt;defaultNamespacePackageMapping&gt;true&lt;/defaultNamespacePackageMapping&gt;<br/>
						&lt;wsdlLocation&gt;&lt;/wsdlLocation&gt;<br/>
						&lt;frontEnd&gt;jaxws&lt;/frontEnd&gt;<br/>
						&lt;dataBinding&gt;jaxb&lt;/dataBinding&gt;<br/>
						&lt;wsdlVersion&gt;1.1&lt;/wsdlVersion&gt;<br/>
						&lt;catalog&gt;catalog&lt;/catalog&gt;<br/>
						&lt;extendedSoapHeaders&gt;true&lt;/extendedSoapHeaders&gt;<br/>
						&lt;validateWsdl&gt;true&lt;/validateWsdl&gt;<br/>
						&lt;serviceName&gt;serviceName&lt;/serviceName&gt;<br/>
						&lt;autoNameResolution&gt;true&lt;/autoNameResolution&gt;<br/>
						&lt;noAddressBinding&gt;true&lt;/noAddressBinding&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/defaultOptions&gt;<br/>

  </td>
