</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently there is one call to the servlet 2.4 API in ServletController. This can be made 2.3 compatible by specifying the encoding in the setContentType(...) call. Attached is a patch to fix this, and enable cxf to run in any servlet 2.3 container.<br/>
<br/>

