                                            <td class="description">      Similar to https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1256, I get a security exception when  using java2ws via the cxf-java2ws-plugin in Netbeans 6.x.<br/>
For CXF-1256 the error was in wsdl2java, for my case the error is in java2ws.<br/>
<br/>
As CXF-1526 was a bug in CXF rather than Netbeans, I figure this is the same case.<br/>
<br/>
