</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ObjectFactory cache doesn&#39;t take classloaders into accout
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Jul/08 03:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Jul/08 14:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Jul/08 04:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.6,                     2.1.1,                     2.0.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.8,                     2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The ObjectFactory cache in the JAXBDataBinding doesn&#39;t take the classloader into account, it only uses the full classname.   If two services use the same classes, but are in different classloaders, creating the JAXB context fails as the object factory is in a different classloader than the beans.
  </td>
