  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The release 2.11 binary distribution contains a file apache-cxf-2.1.1/lib/WHICH_JARS  that states &quot;This directory includes the CXF jar, the CXF manifest jar, the required dependencies&quot; <br/>
<br/>
Under JAX-WS support, it lists <br/>
<br/>
For JAX-WS support:<br/>
- geronimo-ws-metadata.jar [6]<br/>
- jaxws-api.jar [6]<br/>
<br/>
however, the required depenency jaxws-api.jar is not included in the apache-cxf-2.1.1/lib folder of the distribution.
