  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The doc generated doc comments should begin with &quot;/**&quot; with two asterisks instead of one.<br/>
<br/>
When using jaxws:javadoc at the package level, the doc comments should be added to a file called package.html instead of top of every single class that belongs to that package.<br/>
<br/>
When using jaxws:javadoc at the class level, the doc comments are incorrect.  It still contained the generic javadoc comments.<br/>
/**<br/>
 * This class was generated by Apache CXF 2.1.1<br/>
