und for the namespace http://cxf.apache.org/transport/jms.<br/>
     [java]     at org.apache.cxf.transport.DestinationFactoryManagerImpl.getDes<br/>
tinationFactory(DestinationFactoryManagerImpl.java:106)<br/>
