                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      for example, local transport starts with local://, then we need set transportId  as &quot;http://cxf.apache.org/transports/local&quot;, so that the correct destination or conduit could be picked up when use local or camel transport and we  also can avoid hacking transportId mapping like we do for localtransport system test<br/>

  </td>
