                <tr id="issuerow12402407" rel="12402407" data-issuekey="CXF-1749" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1749" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1749">CXF-1749</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Quick Fix for JMS Encoding issue
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Aug/08 20:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Feb/09 22:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 31/Oct/08 12:41 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.10,                     2.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-1668                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The encoding of JMS Messages is wrong if they are sent as TextMessage and the platform encoding is not equal to the message encoding. This issue is linked to CXF-1668. While the other issue handles a long term solution like proposed from Daniel Kulp this issue aims to provide a short term fix.<br/>
<br/>
The short term fix is to avoid the simple getBytes() call and instead call getBytes(&lt;encoding&gt;) with the correct encoding.
  </td>
