  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I would like to expose an EJB 3.0 interface as a webservice using CXF 2.1.2. I prefer using EJB and WebService annotation for the same implementation class.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m not able to find any documentation on how to achieve this or this integration is possible with CXF. WebLogic provides the means to expose EJB 3 as webservice, but I would like to use CXF implementation to achieve this.<br/>
<br/>
Can you please provide some documentation on this.<br/>
<br/>
Sripathi.
  </td>
