                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-codegen-plugin:wsdl2java goal runs wsdl2java tool on all WSDL files avaialable at src/main/resources/wsdl/ dir by default, even when &lt;wsdlOptions&gt; specify a diffenent wsdl(s)
    </p>
