                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Codegen plugin is not detecting constructing the file objects correctly so the .equals(...) is always false so the options aren&#39;t getting merged.   The trick is that the auto loading is using a URI.toString() (so has file: protocol), but just new File(o2.getWsdl()) which then doesn&#39;t parse the protocol part.<br/>
<br/>

