                <tr id="issuerow12404581" rel="12404581" data-issuekey="CXF-1806" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1806" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1806">CXF-1806</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Use Spring JMSTemplate in JMSConduit instead of direct JMS
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Sep/08 22:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/09 17:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Sep/08 09:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.8,                     2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.9,                     2.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using the Spring JMSTemplate has many advantages compared to directly using the JMS API. For example cxf services can participate in Transactions.<br/>
The goal for this issue is to replace JMS API in JMSConduit with JMSTemplate calls. Additionally the JMSConduit should be made more dependency injection friendly. It should not retrieve configuration from the Spring config.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="23/Sep/08 06:28"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2008-09-23T06:28:18+0000">23/Sep/08 6:28 AM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
