    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1809" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1809">CXF-1809</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Annotated @PostConstruct methods called twice on single Spring bean 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eric Sirianni
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eric Sirianni
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Sep/08 15:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/Oct/08 04:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Oct/08 06:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.9,                     2.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Seems like an overlap between CXF&#39;s Jsr250BeanPostProcessor and Spring&#39;s CommonAnnotationBeanPostProcessor:<br/>
<br/>
First invocation:<br/>
