                <tr id="issuerow12404940" rel="12404940" data-issuekey="CXF-1812" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1812" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1812">CXF-1812</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                refactor the pause/resume mechanism in PhaseInterceptorChain
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Sep/08 09:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/09 17:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Sep/08 04:28 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.9,                     2.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      currently the pause/resume in PhaseInterceptorChain doesn&#39;t work.<br/>
If invoke pause() in one interceptor, the PhaseInterceptorChain.doIntercept() will exit with COMPLETE status, which means we have no chance to resume the paused interceptorChain.<br/>
We need use wait/notifyall mechanism to refactor it<br/>
something like in PhaseInterceptorChain.doIntercept(), we add<br/>
           while (state == State.PAUSED) {<br/>
                try {<br/>
                    wait();<br/>
                } catch (InterruptedException e) {<br/>
                }<br/>
            }<br/>
            notifyAll();<br/>
and the resume() method should be<br/>
if (state == State.PAUSED) {<br/>
            state = State.EXECUTING;<br/>
            notifyAll();<br/>
        }
  </td>
