                                            <td class="description">      Here is the error returned when I call the web service from my client. This error occurs when ws-security through interceptors is activated. I have implmented the following tutorial (http://www.lumidant.com/blog/apache-cxf-tutorial-ws-security-with-spring/)<br/>
