                <tr id="issuerow12404993" rel="12404993" data-issuekey="CXF-1816" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1816" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1816">CXF-1816</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Undeploying a CXF web app from tomcat on windows does not delete some CXF files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Antonio Leonforte
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Antonio Leonforte
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 23/Sep/08 17:56 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Feb/11 10:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 12/Jan/10 17:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Integration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">4</td>
                                            <td class="watches">5</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2286,                                                CXF-3361                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows Vista, Tomcat 6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When we try to undeploy a quite large web application (30Mb WAR file) using CXF, the operation completes with no warnings on the Tomcat manager page. However, the following two CXF files are *not* removed from the webapps folder, so that when we try to deploy the application again Tomcat fails. The files are: &quot;cxf-2.0.5-incubator&quot; and &quot;cxf-2.1.2&quot;. Maybe some thread keeps these files locked and prevents tomcat from deleting them? We even tried to stop the application, wait a minute and then try to undeploy, but the above mentioned files were still there.<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
