                <tr id="issuerow12405091" rel="12405091" data-issuekey="CXF-1821" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1821" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1821">CXF-1821</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                UrlUtilities.getStem is parsing a decoded URL
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Will Gomes
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Will Gomes
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Sep/08 18:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Oct/08 03:59 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Oct/08 22:24 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      UrlUtilities.getStem method parses a decoded uri path using lastIndexOf(&#39;/&#39;).  This returns an incorrect &quot;stem&quot; if the baseURI path contained an encoded forward slash. This in turn is results in the WSDLQueryHandler to not recognize a wsdl query.  I&#39;ve attached a patch to fix this issue.
  </td>
