	at com.prozone.poc.ejb.session.PersonWS_PersonWSPort_Client.main(PersonWS_PersonWSPort_Client.java:72)<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.RuntimeException: Invalid QName in mapping: codeNS:Receiver<br/>
