                                            <td class="description">      Currently the following case doesn&#39;t work:<br/>
<br/>
1. Register a ServiceTracker for a service (one that will be satisfied by a remote one).<br/>
2. Register the remote service (e.g. by publishing it into discovery)<br/>
Now we don&#39;t pick up this new service, which should be provided through the ServiceListener callback.
