                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Modifying the response message while logging is not straightforward to achieve. LoggingOutInterceptor needs a protected method which gets called before the actual log. Subclasses of LoggingOutInterceptor  can override the transform method and return whatever transformed message they want to log, e.g. replacing sensitive information with a masking character.
