    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1924" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1924">CXF-1924</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Infinite loop in FileUtils.getDefaultTempDir() when &quot;java.io.tmpdir&quot; directory does not exist
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sean O&#39;Callaghan
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Nov/08 17:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Dec/10 18:57 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Dec/08 16:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.4,                     2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.10,                     2.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      FileUtils.getDefaultTempDir() can go into a infinite loop when the &quot;java.io.tmpdir&quot; system property is set to an non-existent directory. Here&#39;s the code that causes the problem:<br/>
<br/>
            s = System.getProperty(&quot;java.io.tmpdir&quot;);<br/>
            File f = new File(s, &quot;cxf-tmp-&quot; + x);<br/>
            while (!f.mkdir()) {<br/>
                x = (int)(Math.random() * 1000000);<br/>
                f = new File(s, &quot;cxf-tmp-&quot; + x);<br/>
            }<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
