                                            <td class="environment">      Reproduced this on CXF 2.0.9 with Tomcat 5.5.27, the app deploys on 2.1.3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you have a service endpoint implementation that does not specify the WSDL location, with some methods that are not WebMethods and the bare parameter style is used, then CXF will fail to publish the enpoint.<br/>
<br/>
