                <tr id="issuerow12412302" rel="12412302" data-issuekey="CXF-1977" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1977" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1977">CXF-1977</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                simple:frontend cannot use jdk dynamic proxy as serviceBean
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Julian Vassev
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Julian Vassev
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Jan/09 16:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/09 19:37 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/09 16:39 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Simple Frontend            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      java version &quot;1.6.0_11&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.6.0_11-b03)<br/>
Java HotSpot(TM) Client VM (build 11.0-b16, mixed mode, sharing)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have the following spring definition<br/>
&lt;simple:server id=&quot;ws_eventService&quot; serviceClass=&quot;xxx.EventService&quot; address=&quot;/EventService&quot;&gt;<br/>
		&lt;simple:serviceBean&gt;<br/>
  			&lt;ref bean=&quot;eventService&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  		&lt;/simple:serviceBean&gt;<br/>
  		&lt;simple:dataBinding&gt;<br/>
        	       &lt;bean class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.aegis.databinding.AegisDatabinding&quot; /&gt;<br/>
               &lt;/simple:dataBinding&gt;<br/>
&lt;/simple:server&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Here, eventService is a is JDK dynamic proxy that is created by spring (in my case a hessian client proxy). It fails with NPE in AnnotationInterceptors.getAnnotationObject() because ClassHelper.getRealClass(a_JDK_proxy) return null.<br/>
<br/>
The proxy implements the xxx.EventService interface
  </td>
