                <tr id="issuerow12412568" rel="12412568" data-issuekey="CXF-1990" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1990" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1990">CXF-1990</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                3 CTS tests,  invokeAsyncTest(for pojo, ejb and servlet) fail
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jarek Gawor
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Chaitanya Choleti
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Chaitanya Choleti
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Jan/09 07:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Feb/09 22:20 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Jan/09 20:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CTS tests jaxws.ee.w2j.document.literal.async.client.invokeAsyncCallbackTest (for pojo, ejb and servlet client ) fail ocassionally.  The reason being....<br/>
	In the invokeAsync method of JaxWsClientProxy class, ClientCallbacks handleMessage method is overridden.  In this method first ClientCallbacks field done (boolean) is set to true and then handlers handleResponse(Response&lt;?&gt;) is called. In the CTS tests, if a ClientCallback.get() is called in between these two requests, a NullPointerException is thrown as the handlers state remains unchanged.<br/>
	<br/>
	Suggested Fix : synchronize the ClientCallbacks handleResponse in the JaxWsClientProxy.<br/>
	Also, ClientCallback class is a not thread safe so any state change should be done synchronously.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
