                <tr id="issuerow12412827" rel="12412827" data-issuekey="CXF-1994" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-1994" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-1994">CXF-1994</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                An attempt to deregister custom providers fails.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Chaitanya Choleti
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Chaitanya Choleti
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Jan/09 11:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Mar/09 09:32 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Mar/09 05:48 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      1) The method ProviderFactory.deregisterEntityProvide(Object o) does not actually derigister a custom provider.<br/>
2) Consider that the first problem is fixed. Now, if a custom provider which implements both MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter is set and the method deregisterEntityProvide is called it deregisters it as a MessageBodyReader and returns without deregistering it as a MessageBodyWriter.<br/>
3) There is no provision to deregister providers which implement ExceptioMapper.<br/>
<br/>
Please open the attached zip file to find the suggested fix.
  </td>
