  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I get many No Classdef Found errors when doing a mvn install in systest. After I do mvn eclipse:eclipse I get compile errors in eclipse. It seems the directory target/generated/src/test/java is not on the classpath.<br/>
<br/>
Adding the line<br/>
&lt;source&gt;${basedir}/target/generated/src/test/java&lt;/source&gt;<br/>
to the sources of the add sources goal in the pom.xml helped for me but I guess that is not the correct solution. Probably there is some bug in the cxf-codegen plugin. As far as I understand it the codegen plugin should add the above path to the classpath anyway.<br/>
<br/>
Any ideas?<br/>
<br/>
After I added the above line I have only one test failure left.<br/>
 
