                <tr id="issuerow12413428" rel="12413428" data-issuekey="CXF-2009" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2009" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2009">CXF-2009</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unmarshilling response with default namespace fails
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Incomplete
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rakesh Kamath
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rakesh Kamath
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jan/09 02:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Jul/09 20:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Jul/09 19:24 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP, Java 1.5 12, CXF 2.1 
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF is failing while unmarshalling this response.<br/>
<br/>
Response::<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;SOAP-ENV:Envelope xmlns:SOAP-ENV=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;SOAP-ENV:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;ReportBugsResponse xmlns=&quot;http://wwwin-test/url/&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;report&gt;<br/>
&lt;branch&gt;branch1&lt;/branch&gt;<br/>
&lt;bugid&gt;90037&lt;/bugid&gt;<br/>
&lt;time&gt;2006/01/10 19:17:20&lt;/time&gt;<br/>
&lt;branch_csn&gt;10&lt;/branch_csn&gt;<br/>
&lt;branch_id&gt;106&lt;/branch_id&gt;<br/>
&lt;type&gt;direct&lt;/type&gt;<br/>
&lt;ref_point&gt;V11_2&lt;/ref_point&gt;<br/>
&lt;changeset_id&gt;259&lt;/changeset_id&gt;<br/>
&lt;bad_codefix&gt;false&lt;/bad_codefix&gt;<br/>
&lt;regressed&gt;false&lt;/regressed&gt;<br/>
&lt;/report&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ReportBugsResponse&gt;<br/>
&lt;/SOAP-ENV:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/SOAP-ENV:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
When I added namespace prefix &#39;ns2&#39; to namespaceURI &#39;http://wwwin-test/url/&#39; the unmarshalling works.<br/>
I noticed there is CXF-536 bug for this issue but is marked as resolved in version 2.0. I tried version 2.1 and 2.1.3 with no luck.<br/>
<br/>
For now I have added a Interceptor before StaxInInterceptor to transform the response XML.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks. <br/>

  </td>
