                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.cxf.interceptor.InterceptorProvider and its implementation classes refer to the raw Interceptor type. The lack of a generic type signature here means that application code which talks to this API has to have warning suppressions liberally sprinkled around.<br/>
<br/>
At the very least, Interceptor&lt;?&gt; should be used here, if not something more specific.  
  </td>
