</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If you use a wsdl with a mime binding, but don&#39;t enable the code generator to know about it via the &lt;enableMIMEContent&gt;true&lt;/enableMIMEContent&gt; jaxb customization, the resulting code does not work for text/plain or octect-stream.    The generated code uses a String for text/plain and byte[] for octects, but the SwA interceptors won&#39;t map to those types.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

