                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
<br/>
SchemaInfo sch is being accessed without a check if it is null, hence NPE:<br/>
<br/>
            SchemaInfo sch =<br/>
part.getMessageInfo().getOperation().getInterface()<br/>
                .getService().getSchema(namespace);<br/>
            if (!sch.isElementFormQualified()) { // &lt;== NPE<br/>
                namespace = null;<br/>
            }<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
